{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Sgve9yvULdoF8mR2br91xm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted results for each **planned** experiment in the experiment_plan, under the \"best\" tier scenario. \n\nLet me identify all planned experiments:\n- plan_011: Walker Walk 008d seeds 1-2 (status: planned)\n- plan_012: Walker Walk 008f seeds 1-2 (status: planned)\n- plan_014: Walker Walk 008e_v3 seeds 1-2 (status: planned)\n- plan_013: Walker Walk 008a seeds 1-2 (status: planned)\n- plan_020: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n\n\n- plan_021: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n- plan_022: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n- plan_023: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n- plan_030: RSSM prediction quality\n- plan_031: Actor entropy analysis\n- plan_032: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n- plan_033: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n- plan_050: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n- plan_051: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n- plan_052: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n- plan_015: Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb (1 seed)\n- plan_016: Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\n- plan_034: NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\n- plan_060: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\n\nNow I'm checking the status fields to see which of these are actually still planned versus already completed. I'm noticing a discrepancy between the plan statuses and what's actually in the experiment registry—several experiments marked as \"planned\" have already been completed. Since the user wants detailed predictions for all planned experiments, I should work with the plan_experiment data as given, even though some of these may have already run. So I need to check what's actually still in progress versus what's already completed in the registry. For the truly pending experiments like the vanilla dreamerv3 run, the analyzing SGS variant, and the preparing no-dt-embed version, I'll predict outcomes based on the best-tier hypotheses around dt_embedding dimensions and cross-environment generalization.\n\nLooking at the core predictions: the cheetah control experiment should show NVE under 1.5× across seeds, the 008f variant without dt embeddings should confirm this holds even when that component is absent, and the full-SGS approach should push NVE down to 1.1× or better by eliminating the CIVO issue entirely. The vanilla baseline needs to match the original experiment to rule out any code or environment confounds, and I'm expecting the 1.5× threshold classification to maintain 90%+ accuracy even with expanded seeds. The reviewers should accept the diagnostic framing and the MPC-versus-imagination comparison as the core novelty contribution.\n\nNow I'm compiling the expected ranges for each metric across these experiments.\n\nFor the planned experiments, I need to generate predictions aligned with the best-case scenario—where experiments that already have data in the registry confirm the expected outcomes, and those still pending show the anticipated results based on the parameter ranges I've established.\n\nContinuing through the remaining planned experiments: plan_013 shows V-recovery with NVE suppressed, plan_014 demonstrates the dual pathway effect with mixed outcomes across seeds, plan_015 confirms that frozen embeddings prevent collapse entirely, plan_016 replicates the ~50% collapse pattern through alternative mechanisms, plan_020 establishes the Cheetah baseline stability, plan_021 shows dramatic collapse when trained embeddings are applied to Cheetah, and plan_022 demonstrates that removing the embedding dimension altogether prevents NVE elevation.\n\nNow moving into the diagnostic experiments—plan_023 tests untrained embeddings on Cheetah showing V-recovery with suppressed NVE, plan_030 quantifies the RSSM degradation at dt=2, plan_031 reveals the entropy divergence between collapse pathways, plan_032 shows the bimodal value distribution in collapsed states, plan_033 tracks how dt_embedding cosine similarity diverges during training, and plan_034 establishes the NVE threshold sensitivity with strong AUROC. Then replicating the core findings on Cartpole—plan_050 through plan_052 confirm the same pattern of baseline stability, collapse with trained embeddings, and stability with zero embedding dimension. Finally, plan_060 begins exploring uncertainty-gated truncation as a potential mitigation.\n\nI'm noticing that plan_015 with frozen dt_emb is already in the registry showing negative results—NVE stayed below 1.5x but revealed gradient starvation and poor performance instead. This actually strengthens the narrative that dt_emb training is essential for CIVO, just with a different failure mode when it's prevented. The best tier results confirm this across multiple seeds and environments, so I should integrate this finding into the overall story.\n\nFor the remaining experiments, I need to predict what the optimistic scenario looks like given what's already been collected—treating the pending runs as confirmatory steps that would solidify the causal chain rather than exploratory unknowns.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41989,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41989},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"08bdb50e-1069-4ff6-8dd1-d71d2e122e57","uuid":"f7f9e6cd-b3a7-40d3-a110-253ddc33e516"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Sgve9yvULdoF8mR2br91xm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立——CIVO 是 imagination-based actor-critic 中 dt-conditioning 的架构特异性漏洞。\n  所有待定实验确认因果链；Cheetah 控制实验干净复现；NVE 阈值保持完美分类；CIVO 分解 + TAWM 对比构成清晰 novelty。\n  Claims C1-C5 原样保留，C6 以 dual-pathway 形式呈现反而增加深度。\n  主 selling point：首次系统性因果诊断 + 量化 CIVO 贡献 + 揭示 MPC/imagination 范式差异。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"用 2 个额外 seed 复现 trained dt_emb 触发 CIVO 崩溃的现象\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_peak: 170\n      seed1_eval_collapse: 83\n      seed1_nve_peak: 4.12\n      seed1_nve_sustained_above_1_5x: true\n      seed1_collapse: true\n      seed2_eval_final_105K: 268\n      seed2_nve_peak: 2.05\n      seed2_nve_transient: true\n      seed2_self_correction: true\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      collapse_rate: 0.5\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_rate: 1.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档要求 walker_trained_dt_emb_collapse_rate 在 [0.33, 0.67]。\n      Trained dt_emb 通过 observation decoder 梯度学会精确 dt 预测，但 RSSM 在 dt>1 时 reward gap=2.78x，\n      系统性地让 critic 高估 dt>1 imagination rollout 的价值。\n      所有 trained dt_emb seed 都应超过 NVE 1.5x（因果机制一致），\n      但崩溃是否锁定取决于 early training stochasticity：\n      初始化和数据采样顺序决定 overestimation feedback loop 是否在 correction 力量压制前锁定。\n      1/2 崩溃率正是这种\"必要但非充分\"模式的体现——NVE>1.5x 是可靠诊断标志，崩溃是随机后果。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008d multi-seed NVE trajectory\"\n        columns: [\"step\", \"seed0_nve\", \"seed1_nve\", \"seed2_nve\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"25K\", \"1.78\", \"1.78\", \"2.05\"]\n          - [\"35K\", \"1.71\", \"1.71\", \"1.24\"]\n          - [\"45K\", \"2.09\", \"2.09\", \"1.62\"]\n          - [\"55K\", \"4.12\", \"4.12\", \"1.41\"]\n          - [\"65K\", \"-\", \"1.23\", \"0.94\"]\n          - [\"105K\", \"-\", \"1.57\", \"0.38\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"NVE trajectory 三 seed 叠加图：seed 0/1 sustained >1.5x → collapse；seed 2 transient >1.5x → self-correction\"\n    analysis: >\n      2/2 seeds 超过 NVE 1.5x 阈值（100% 触发率），但仅 1/2 实际崩溃（50% 崩溃率）。\n      NVE>1.5x 作为 trained dt_emb 的诊断标志达到完美灵敏度。\n      崩溃的随机性源于 primacy bias (Qiao et al. 2023)——early outlier experiences 决定 feedback loop 是否锁定。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"复现因果控制实验——去掉 dt_embedding 后 NVE 保持健康\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 503\n      seed1_nve_peak: 1.02\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.30\n      seed2_eval_peak: 359\n      seed2_eval_105K: 148\n      seed2_nve_peak: 1.26\n      seed2_nve_105K: 1.14\n      both_seeds_nve_below_1_5x: true\n      recovery_pattern: \"seed 1 zigzag recovery; seed 2 decline after 75K but NVE stays below threshold\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      去掉 dt_embed_dim=0 后，reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2（reward gap 仅 1.01x），\n      CIVO 的正反馈环路从根本上被切断——critic 无法利用精确 dt 信息进行系统性高估。\n      两个 seed 的 NVE 都不会超过 1.5x（实际 peak 分别为 1.02x 和 1.26x），\n      但去掉 dt_embedding 的 trade-off 是 reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 75x），\n      导致 reward 信号含噪，eval 轨迹高方差（seed 2 在 75K 后 decline 到 148）。\n      这是因果控制实验——证明\"去掉 → 不崩\"，而非推荐方案。\n      关键：即使 seed 2 表现差（148@105K），NVE 仍仅 1.14x，远低于 trained dt_emb 的 2.09x。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008f vs 008d NVE 对比（因果分离）\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"config\", \"nve_peak\", \"nve_105K\", \"collapse\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"seed 0\", \"008d (trained)\", \"2.09\", \"collapsed@55K\", \"YES\"]\n          - [\"seed 0\", \"008f (no dt_emb)\", \"1.02\", \"0.30\", \"NO\"]\n          - [\"seed 1\", \"009e (trained)\", \"4.12\", \"1.57\", \"YES\"]\n          - [\"seed 1\", \"009f (no dt_emb)\", \"1.02\", \"0.30\", \"NO\"]\n          - [\"seed 2\", \"009b (trained)\", \"2.05\", \"0.38 (self-correct)\", \"NO\"]\n          - [\"seed 2\", \"009c (no dt_emb)\", \"1.26\", \"1.14\", \"NO\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"NVE 6 条线对比图：trained (红, 3 seeds) vs no_dt_emb (蓝, 3 seeds)，清晰分离带\"\n    analysis: >\n      NVE 1.5x 阈值在扩展到 6 个数据点后仍保持完美分类：\n      trained 3/3 超过 1.5x，no_dt_emb 0/3 超过 1.5x → 分类精度 100%。\n      这是论文最强的定量结果——简单阈值实现完美因果分离。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: \"dt=1 imagination 多 seed 验证——预期揭示 dual-pathway vulnerability\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 869.9\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.80\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed2_eval_105K: 137\n      seed2_nve_105K: 3.78\n      seed2_collapse: true\n      seed2_collapse_pathway: \"non-CIVO (eval-driven, entropy↑)\"\n      collapse_rate: 0.5\n      gate_dt_1_frac_both_seeds: 1.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      dt=1 imagination 消除 Pathway A (经典 CIVO: dt>1 rollout 中 RSSM fidelity gap 导致 value explosion)。\n      但 trained dt_embedding 仍通过 training data 中的 dt>1 transitions 影响 critic 训练——\n      即使 imagination 不使用 dt>1，critic 仍在 real data 的 dt=2 transitions 上训练，\n      dt_emb 的 93% 梯度来自 observation decoders 使其学到 dt-specific representations。\n      Pathway B (non-CIVO policy instability)：当 critic 对 dt>1 real transitions 的估值偏差\n      通过 Bellman backup 传播到 dt=1 状态时，policy 变得不稳定（entropy↑ 而非↓），\n      eval 先崩（policy 随机化）→ NVE 被动升高（分母缩小）。\n      50% 崩溃率与 008d 相同说明 dt=1 imagination 未降低风险——\n      vulnerability 的根源是 trained dt_embedding 本身，不是 imagination 步长。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008e_v3 dual-pathway dynamics\"\n        columns: [\"feature\", \"seed 1 (healthy)\", \"seed 2 (Pathway B collapse)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"value change 85K→105K\", \"stable (351→458, +30%)\", \"stable (339→340, +0.3%)\"]\n          - [\"eval change 85K→105K\", \"657→870 (+32%)\", \"715→137 (-81%)\"]\n          - [\"NVE driver\", \"N/A (healthy)\", \"eval denominator crash\"]\n          - [\"actor_entropy 85K→105K\", \"-5.21→-5.10 (stable)\", \"-5.21→-3.83 (destabilizing)\"]\n          - [\"mechanism\", \"N/A\", \"policy instability → eval crash → NVE passive rise\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dual panel: seed 1 vs seed 2 learning curves + actor_entropy + NVE，标注 Pathway A vs B 特征\"\n    analysis: >\n      C6 partially falsified 是论文的意外亮点——\"trained dt_embedding creates vulnerability \n      through multiple pathways\" 比原来的\"dt=1 fixes it\"更深刻。\n      Pathway A (CIVO) 需要 dt>1 imagination；Pathway B (policy instability) 独立于 imagination dt。\n      这解释了为什么 surface-level fixes 不够，推动了对 hierarchical approaches (THICK, Hieros) 的论证。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"复现 untrained dt_emb 的 value growth suppression + V-recovery 模式\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 720\n      seed1_nve_range: [0.55, 0.90]\n      seed1_recovery_cycles: 2\n      seed2_eval_105K: 690\n      seed2_nve_range: [0.50, 0.85]\n      seed2_recovery_cycles: 1\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate: 0.0\n      vs_baseline_range: [-20%, -10%]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Untrained dt_embedding 是随机固定向量——critic 无法从中提取有用的 dt 信息，\n      因此无法对 dt>1 states 产生系统性高估。NVE 被结构性压制在 baseline 水平以下（0.5-0.9x）。\n      V-recovery 模式源于：没有 trained dt_emb 放大 overestimation，\n      actor 的错误策略（从 dt>1 data 学到的次优行为）仍可通过 real environment returns 纠正——\n      correction 力量不会被 critic overestimation 压制。\n      额外 seed 应复现此模式因为机制是结构性的（dt_emb 不训练 → 信息阻断），\n      而非依赖 stochastic 初始化。性能略低于 baseline (-10~-20%) 因为 subsample OFF 但 dt>1 \n      transitions 仍存在 RSSM error，actor 需要周期性\"unlearn\"错误策略。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008a multi-seed normalized v/e\"\n        columns: [\"step\", \"seed0\", \"seed1\", \"seed2\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"55K\", \"0.93\", \"0.88\", \"0.82\"]\n          - [\"65K\", \"0.66\", \"0.72\", \"0.68\"]\n          - [\"75K\", \"0.75\", \"0.70\", \"0.65\"]\n          - [\"85K\", \"0.68\", \"0.62\", \"0.58\"]\n          - [\"95K\", \"0.79\", \"0.75\", \"0.70\"]\n          - [\"105K\", \"0.59\", \"0.55\", \"0.52\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-seed NVE band plot: shaded region 0.5-0.93x，对比 trained dt_emb 的 1.5-4x\"\n    analysis: >\n      C3 cross-seed 一致性强化——structural suppression 不依赖 seed。\n      NVE 的逐步下降趋势（从 0.9x 到 0.5x over 50K steps）表明抑制效果随训练加强而非衰减。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"冻结 dt_embedding (requires_grad=False) 验证 TRAINING 是 CIVO 必要条件\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_105K: 204\n      nve_peak: 0.47\n      nve_sustained: [0.39, 0.47]\n      collapse: false\n      gradient_starvation: true\n      actor_loss_near_zero: true\n      gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Frozen dt_emb (random, requires_grad=False) 完全阻断 CIVO：\n      dt_emb 不训练 → 不会学到 dt-specific representations → reward head 和 observation decoder\n      无法利用 dt 信息产生系统性偏差 → critic 无法系统性高估 dt>1 states。\n      NVE 0.39-0.47 远低于 1.0（critic UNDER-estimates），原因是 frozen random embedding\n      注入噪声到 RSSM，干扰 state prediction 质量。\n      但出现新问题：gradient starvation——frozen embedding 作为常量噪声使 actor gradient\n      信号减弱（actor_loss → 0），导致性能停滞在 ~200（baseline 22%）。\n      这不是 CIVO 崩溃，而是不同失败模式（信息瓶颈），进一步确认：\n      dt_emb 的 TRAINING（而非 presence）才是 CIVO 的 necessary condition。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"2×2 dt_emb 消融矩阵\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"dt_emb state\", \"NVE peak\", \"collapse\", \"failure mode\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"008d\", \"trained\", \"4.12\", \"YES (1/2)\", \"CIVO → value explosion\"]\n          - [\"008f\", \"absent (dim=0)\", \"1.26\", \"NO\", \"reward noise (MAE 75x)\"]\n          - [\"015b\", \"frozen (random)\", \"0.47\", \"NO\", \"gradient starvation\"]\n          - [\"008a\", \"trained (unexposed)\", \"0.93\", \"NO\", \"mild V-recovery\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: NVE peak across 4 dt_emb conditions，1.5x threshold line\"\n    analysis: >\n      三种非 CIVO 失败模式（reward noise, gradient starvation, mild degradation）都不触发 NVE>1.5x。\n      只有 actively trained dt_emb exposed to dt>1 data 才触发 CIVO。\n      2×2 matrix: {trained vs not} × {exposed to dt>1 vs not} 清晰表明 BOTH training AND exposure 是必要条件。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"窄化 dt=1 imagination 下 non-CIVO 崩溃率的置信区间\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed3_collapse: false\n      seed3_eval_105K: 820\n      seed3_nve_105K: 0.75\n      seed4_collapse: true\n      seed4_eval_105K: 185\n      seed4_nve_105K: 2.90\n      seed4_pathway: \"Pathway B (eval-driven)\"\n      total_collapse_rate_4seeds: 0.5\n      ci_95_collapse_rate: [0.15, 0.85]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 collapse rate 稳定在 ~50%（与 008d 的 dt=2 imagination 相同）。\n      这是关键发现——dt=1 imagination 不降低崩溃概率，说明 vulnerability 根源在 trained dt_embedding\n      而非 imagination 步长。2/4 seeds 崩溃给出 Clopper-Pearson 95% CI [0.15, 0.85]，\n      中位估计 0.5 与 008d 一致。崩溃的 seed 都表现 Pathway B 特征（entropy↑, eval-driven），\n      而非 Pathway A (CIVO)——dt=1 imagination 成功消除了 Pathway A 但暴露了 Pathway B。\n      Healthy seed 的 eval 比 baseline 略低（820-870 vs 916）可能源于 subsample ON 的 learning signal 减少。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008e_v3 all-seed collapse summary\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval@105K\", \"NVE@105K\", \"collapse\", \"pathway\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"seed 1 (original)\", \"870\", \"0.80\", \"NO\", \"-\"]\n          - [\"seed 2\", \"137\", \"3.78\", \"YES\", \"Pathway B\"]\n          - [\"seed 3\", \"820\", \"0.75\", \"NO\", \"-\"]\n          - [\"seed 4\", \"185\", \"2.90\", \"YES\", \"Pathway B\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4-seed eval trajectory fan chart，collapsed seeds 标红，healthy 标绿\"\n    analysis: >\n      50% collapse rate (2/4) 是 dual-pathway vulnerability 的强证据。\n      Pathway B 的 reproducibility 说明它不是 outlier——是 trained dt_embedding 的系统性后果。\n      论文表述：\"even restricting imagination to dt=1 does not eliminate the vulnerability \n      created by training a dt-embedding; collapse probability remains ~50%.\"\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_020\"\n    description: \"第二个 DMC 环境的 dt=1 baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_peak: 849.8\n      seed1_eval_final: 849.8\n      seed2_eval_peak: 820\n      seed2_eval_final: 810\n      seed3_eval_peak: 860\n      seed3_eval_final: 840\n      cross_seed_mean_final: 833\n      cross_seed_std_final: 20\n      ve_stable_range: [0.65, 0.72]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cheetah Run 是标准 DMC locomotion 任务，DreamerV3 在此环境表现稳定。\n      已有 exp_010a 的 seed 1 达到 849.8 peak，额外 seed 应在 ±5% 范围内。\n      V/E ratio 稳定在 0.65-0.72（与 Walker Walk 一致），确认 value calibration \n      在不同环境间具有一致性——这是 NVE 阈值跨环境泛化的前提条件。\n      3 seed 的低方差（std ~20/833 = 2.4%）确认 baseline 稳定，\n      为后续 CIVO trigger 实验提供干净参照。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cheetah Run baseline 3-seed summary\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_peak\", \"eval_final\", \"ve_stable\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"seed 1 (010a)\", \"849.8\", \"849.8\", \"0.68\"]\n          - [\"seed 2\", \"820\", \"810\", \"0.66\"]\n          - [\"seed 3\", \"860\", \"840\", \"0.70\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-seed learning curves with shaded IQM confidence band\"\n    analysis: >\n      Baseline 跨 seed 高度一致（IQR < 5%），为 CIVO 检测提供低噪声参照。\n      这是 CoRL 审稿的基本要求——R1 (单环境) 被 Cheetah 复现直接回应。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_021\"\n    description: \"跨环境复现 CIVO collapse——关键假设验证\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_nve_peak: 14.59\n      seed1_collapse: true\n      seed1_collapse_step: 55000\n      seed2_nve_peak: 12.0\n      seed2_collapse: true\n      seed2_collapse_step: 65000\n      seed3_nve_peak: 8.5\n      seed3_collapse: false\n      seed3_self_correction: true\n      cross_seed_nve_exceeds_1_5x: 3\n      collapse_rate: 0.67\n      cheetah_civo_trigger_nve_peak_range: [8.5, 14.59]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档要求 cheetah_civo_trigger_nve_peak 在 [10.0, 18.0]。\n      已有 exp_010b (seed 1) 达到 NVE 14.59x 并崩溃。\n      Cheetah 的 CIVO 比 Walker 更剧烈原因：Cheetah 的 observation space 更高维（velocity-dominant），\n      RSSM 在 dt>1 时的 obs prediction error 更大，dt_emb 的 93% observation decoder 梯度\n      更强烈地将 dt-specific bias encode 到 embedding 中。\n      3/3 seeds 应超过 NVE 1.5x（100% 触发率），2/3 崩溃（collapse_rate ~0.67，\n      Walker 的 0.5 在 Cheetah 中可能更高因为 fidelity gap 更大）。\n      NVE peak 在 8.5-14.59 范围内，落入 best 档的 [10, 18] 区间。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cheetah CIVO trigger NVE trajectory\"\n        columns: [\"step\", \"seed1_nve\", \"seed2_nve\", \"seed3_nve\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"25K\", \"1.9\", \"1.7\", \"1.5\"]\n          - [\"35K\", \"3.2\", \"2.8\", \"2.1\"]\n          - [\"45K\", \"5.8\", \"4.5\", \"3.8\"]\n          - [\"55K\", \"9.1\", \"7.2\", \"5.5\"]\n          - [\"65K\", \"14.59\", \"12.0\", \"8.5\"]\n          - [\"75K\", \"collapsed\", \"collapsed\", \"6.2\"]\n          - [\"85K\", \"-\", \"-\", \"4.1\"]\n          - [\"95K\", \"-\", \"-\", \"2.8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cheetah NVE trajectory: 3 seeds with collapse markers, 1.5x threshold highlighted\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨环境 CIVO 复现是论文最关键的 gap closure。\n      Cheetah 的更剧烈 NVE (14.59x vs Walker 4.12x) 来自更大的 obs fidelity gap，\n      提供了 C4 (longer dt amplifies) 的间接支持——更复杂的 dynamics → 更大的 dt>1 预测误差 → 更强 CIVO。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_022\"\n    description: \"跨环境因果控制——去掉 dt_embedding 阻断 CIVO\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_nve_peak: 0.95\n      seed2_nve_peak: 1.10\n      seed3_nve_peak: 1.20\n      all_seeds_below_1_5x: true\n      mean_eval_105K: 280\n      vs_baseline: -66%\n      collapse_rate: 0.0\n      cheetah_control_nve_peak: 1.20\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档核心假设 #1：\"Cheetah dt_embed_dim=0 控制实验 NVE < 1.5×\"。\n      机制与 Walker 008f 相同：去掉 dt_embedding → reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2\n      → CIVO 正反馈环路被切断。\n      NVE peak 预期 0.95-1.20（落入 best 档 [0.3, 1.3]）。\n      Eval 性能低（~280 vs baseline 833, -66%）因为与 Walker 008f 相同的 trade-off：\n      reward_MAE 显著升高，reward 信号含噪。\n      但关键对比是 NVE：021 的 3/3 seeds 超过 1.5x vs 022 的 0/3 seeds 超过 1.5x →\n      跨环境 6/6 perfect classification（加上 Walker 的 6/6 = 总计 12/12）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cheetah 因果分离：trained vs no_dt_emb\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"seed\", \"NVE peak\", \"collapse\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"021 (trained)\", \"1\", \"14.59\", \"YES\"]\n          - [\"021 (trained)\", \"2\", \"12.0\", \"YES\"]\n          - [\"021 (trained)\", \"3\", \"8.5\", \"NO (self-correct)\"]\n          - [\"022 (no dt_emb)\", \"1\", \"0.95\", \"NO\"]\n          - [\"022 (no dt_emb)\", \"2\", \"1.10\", \"NO\"]\n          - [\"022 (no dt_emb)\", \"3\", \"1.20\", \"NO\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cheetah NVE comparison: 6 lines, clear separation band at 1.5x\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨环境因果控制成功复现：environments_with_clean_replication = 2 (Walker + Cheetah)，\n      满足 best 档 [2, 3] 要求。12/12 NVE threshold classification → accuracy 100%。\n      这是回应 R1 (单环境) 的核心证据。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_023\"\n    description: \"跨环境 C3 验证——untrained dt_emb 的 value suppression 在 Cheetah 中复现\"\n    expected_results:\n      mean_eval_105K: 620\n      vs_baseline: -25%\n      nve_range: [0.45, 0.85]\n      recovery_cycles: 1.5\n      collapse_rate: 0.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Untrained dt_emb 的保护机制是结构性的（information blockade），应跨环境一致。\n      Cheetah 的 V-recovery 可能不如 Walker 显著（-25% vs Walker -15%）因为 Cheetah \n      dynamics 更复杂，untrained dt_emb 的噪声对 RSSM state prediction 干扰更大。\n      NVE 一致性保持在 0.45-0.85x（suppressed below baseline），0/3 seeds 崩溃。\n      这完成了 C3 的跨环境验证——untrained dt_emb 的 value growth suppression \n      不是 Walker-specific 现象。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"C3 cross-environment NVE suppression\"\n        columns: [\"environment\", \"config\", \"NVE range\", \"vs_baseline\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Walker\", \"008a (untrained, H=15)\", \"0.59-0.93\", \"-15%\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah\", \"023 (untrained, H=15)\", \"0.45-0.85\", \"-25%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-environment NVE suppression band: Walker vs Cheetah, both below 1.0x\"\n    analysis: >\n      C3 跨环境一致确认 untrained dt_emb 的保护是 architecture-level property，\n      不是 environment-specific artifact。性能差异 (-15% vs -25%) 可归因于 Cheetah \n      更高的 observation dimensionality 使 random embedding noise 影响更大。\n\n  - name: \"RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_030\"\n    description: \"量化 RSSM fidelity gap——CIVO 的机制基础\"\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_obs_gap: 2.04\n      008d_obs_gap: 1.30\n      008f_obs_gap: 2.75\n      008d_reward_gap: 2.78\n      008f_reward_gap: 1.01\n      cheetah_baseline_obs_gap: 2.50\n      cheetah_010b_reward_gap: 3.20\n    result_rationale: >\n      已有 Walker 数据（exp_rssm_fidelity_analysis）。扩展到 Cheetah 应显示更大的 fidelity gap\n      因为 Cheetah 的 dynamics 更复杂（高速 locomotion, velocity dominant observations）。\n      Cheetah 的 obs_gap 2.50x (vs Walker 2.04x) 和 reward_gap 3.20x (vs Walker 2.78x)\n      解释了为什么 Cheetah CIVO 更剧烈 (NVE peak 14.59x vs Walker 4.12x)——\n      更大的 fidelity gap → 更大的 systematic value bias → 更快的 positive feedback。\n      RSSM 在 dt>1 时本质上是做更长期的一步预测，prediction error 随 dt 增大而增大\n      符合 latent dynamics model 的基本性质。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-environment RSSM fidelity\"\n        columns: [\"env\", \"model\", \"dt1_obs_MSE\", \"dt2_obs_MSE\", \"obs_gap\", \"reward_gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Walker\", \"baseline\", \"13.49\", \"27.50\", \"2.04x\", \"1.56x\"]\n          - [\"Walker\", \"008d (trained)\", \"41.31\", \"53.67\", \"1.30x\", \"2.78x\"]\n          - [\"Walker\", \"008f (no dt_emb)\", \"8.01\", \"22.04\", \"2.75x\", \"1.01x\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah\", \"baseline\", \"18.2\", \"45.5\", \"2.50x\", \"1.80x\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah\", \"010b (trained)\", \"55.4\", \"68.2\", \"1.23x\", \"3.20x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: obs_MSE × reward_MAE for dt=1 vs dt=2, across models and environments\"\n    analysis: >\n      关键洞察：008d/010b 的低 obs_gap ratio (1.30x/1.23x) 具有误导性——\n      它们的 dt=1 绝对误差已是 baseline 3x（模型整体崩坏），ratio 低是因为分子分母都大。\n      论文必须并排呈现绝对值和 ratio。trained dt_emb 的高 reward_gap (2.78x/3.20x) \n      是 CIVO 的直接机制证据——critic 在 dt>1 时系统性高估 reward。\n\n  - name: \"Actor entropy analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_031\"\n    description: \"区分 Pathway A (CIVO, entropy↓) vs Pathway B (policy instability, entropy↑)\"\n    expected_results:\n      008d_s0_entropy_trend: \"decreasing (-3.47→-4.88, policy over-committing)\"\n      009e_s1_entropy_trend: \"decreasing (-3.5→-4.9)\"\n      008e_v3_s2_entropy_trend: \"increasing (-5.21→-3.83, policy destabilizing)\"\n      baseline_entropy_stable: \"-5.0 to -5.2 (converged)\"\n      008a_entropy: \"stable around -4.5 (slightly higher than baseline)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Actor entropy 是区分两种崩溃 pathway 的关键诊断指标。\n      Pathway A (CIVO): value overestimation → actor exploitation → entropy↓（policy 变确定性地追求\n      被高估的 state sequences）→ actor 锁死在错误策略。\n      Pathway B (non-CIVO): policy instability → entropy↑（policy 失去结构，变得接近随机）\n      → eval 下降 → NVE 被动升高。\n      这两种签名清晰可分，为 dual-pathway 叙事提供了独立的诊断证据。\n      Untrained dt_emb (008a) entropy 略高于 baseline 因为 actor 周期性探索\n      （对应 V-recovery 的 dip phases）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Entropy trajectory comparison\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"entropy@35K\", \"entropy@55K\", \"entropy@85K\", \"entropy@105K\", \"pathway\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"baseline\", \"-3.8\", \"-5.0\", \"-5.1\", \"-5.1\", \"healthy\"]\n          - [\"008d s0 (collapse)\", \"-3.5\", \"-4.9\", \"-\", \"-\", \"A (CIVO)\"]\n          - [\"008e_v3 s2 (collapse)\", \"-3.5\", \"-5.1\", \"-5.2\", \"-3.8\", \"B (instability)\"]\n          - [\"008a (untrained)\", \"-2.8\", \"-4.2\", \"-4.5\", \"-4.5\", \"healthy (suppressed)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Entropy time series: 4 configs overlaid, collapse-type annotations\"\n    analysis: >\n      Entropy divergence 是 Pathway A/B 的 cleanest separator——\n      在 collapse onset 时 entropy 方向相反 (↓ vs ↑) 是定性不同的失败机制的强证据。\n      这支持 \"multiple vulnerability pathways\" 的核心叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_032\"\n    description: \"直接展示 V(s) 与 Monte Carlo return 的偏离分布\"\n    expected_results:\n      008d_bias: \"+45% systematic overestimation at dt>1 states\"\n      008f_bias: \"±15% unbiased noise (no systematic direction)\"\n      baseline_bias: \"+5% mild optimism (normal for DreamerV3)\"\n      008d_distribution_shape: \"right-skewed (heavy positive tail)\"\n      008f_distribution_shape: \"symmetric, wide (noise-dominated)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      V/E ratio 是粗糙代理指标——distribution plot 直接展示偏离的结构。\n      Trained dt_emb (008d) 应显示 systematic positive bias（右偏分布），\n      特别是在 dt>1 states 上——critic 在这些 states 一致性地过高估计。\n      No dt_emb (008f) 应显示对称的宽分布——没有系统性方向，只有噪声。\n      这直接回应 R3 (v/e ratio is crude proxy) 的审稿顾虑。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Violin plot: V(s) - MC_return distribution for baseline/008d/008f, split by dt=1 vs dt=2 states\"\n    analysis: >\n      可视化证据直接 compelling 审稿人——不需要他们相信 ratio 代理足够。\n      008d 在 dt=2 states 的 systematic positive skew 是 CIVO 的\"smoking gun visualization\"。\n\n  - name: \"dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_033\"\n    description: \"分析 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 在训练过程中的分化\"\n    expected_results:\n      initial_cosine_sim: 0.0\n      008d_cosine_sim_35K: 0.15\n      008d_cosine_sim_55K: 0.08\n      008a_cosine_sim_105K: 0.02\n      frozen_cosine_sim: 0.0\n      dt_emb_norm_008d_35K: 2.3\n      dt_emb_norm_008a_105K: 0.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      dt_embedding 初始化为 random → cosine similarity 接近 0。\n      训练过程中 008d 的 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 应分化——cosine similarity 保持低\n      但 norm 增大（embedding 获得\"意义\"——不同 dt 映射到不同的高范数向量）。\n      008a (unexposed) 的 embedding 虽然 trainable 但未见过 dt>1 data，\n      norm 应保持接近初始化水平（无训练信号驱动增长）。\n      这提供了 dt_emb TRAINING 如何encode dt-specific information 的直接证据，\n      补充了 gradient decomposition 的分析。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"dt_embedding vector statistics\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"step\", \"||emb_dt1||\", \"||emb_dt2||\", \"cosine(dt1,dt2)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"008d\", \"5K\", \"0.5\", \"0.5\", \"0.02\"]\n          - [\"008d\", \"35K\", \"1.8\", \"2.3\", \"0.15\"]\n          - [\"008d\", \"55K\", \"2.5\", \"3.1\", \"0.08\"]\n          - [\"008a\", \"105K\", \"0.5\", \"0.4\", \"0.01\"]\n          - [\"015b (frozen)\", \"105K\", \"0.5\", \"0.5\", \"0.00\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Embedding norm trajectory + cosine similarity over training\"\n    analysis: >\n      Trained dt_emb 的高 norm + 低 cosine 说明两个 embedding 都\"学到了东西\"但\"学到了不同的东西\"。\n      这直接对应 dt_emb 的 93% 梯度来自 obs decoders——embedding 学到了 dt-specific 的 \n      observation reconstruction bias，而这正是 CIVO 的信息来源。\n\n  - name: \"NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_034\"\n    description: \"系统分析 NVE 阈值的分类精度和 AUROC\"\n    expected_results:\n      threshold_1_3x_accuracy: 0.83\n      threshold_1_5x_accuracy: 1.0\n      threshold_1_7x_accuracy: 1.0\n      threshold_2_0x_accuracy: 0.83\n      auroc: 1.0\n      optimal_threshold: 1.5\n      n_datapoints: 12\n      false_positive_rate_at_1_5x: 0.0\n      false_negative_rate_at_1_5x: 0.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档要求 nve_threshold_classification_accuracy ≥ 90%。\n      从已有数据：trained dt_emb 的 NVE peaks = [4.12, 2.09, 2.05, 1.62, 14.59, ...]\n      vs no dt_emb peaks = [1.02, 1.26, 0.93, 0.47, ...]。\n      在 1.5x 阈值：所有 trained seeds 超过（sensitivity=100%），所有 untrained seeds 不超过（specificity=100%）。\n      1.3x 阈值会产生 false positive（009c@105K=1.14x 仍低于 1.3x，但 009b@25K=2.05x 的 \n      early transient 可能在 25K 时 baseline v/e 不稳定导致误判——但 35K+ 限定后没问题）。\n      2.0x 阈值会漏掉 009b@45K=1.62x（false negative）。\n      1.5x 是最优阈值——在 35K+ 限定下实现完美分类。\n      扩展到 Cheetah 后（3 trained + 3 untrained = 6 点），总 n=12 仍保持 100% accuracy。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"NVE threshold sensitivity\"\n        columns: [\"threshold\", \"true_pos\", \"false_neg\", \"true_neg\", \"false_pos\", \"accuracy\", \"F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1.3x\", \"6/6\", \"0/6\", \"5/6\", \"1/6\", \"0.92\", \"0.92\"]\n          - [\"1.5x\", \"6/6\", \"0/6\", \"6/6\", \"0/6\", \"1.00\", \"1.00\"]\n          - [\"1.7x\", \"5/6\", \"1/6\", \"6/6\", \"0/6\", \"0.92\", \"0.91\"]\n          - [\"2.0x\", \"4/6\", \"2/6\", \"6/6\", \"0/6\", \"0.83\", \"0.80\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ROC curve with threshold markers; shaded optimal region around 1.5x\"\n    analysis: >\n      AUROC=1.0 说明 trained vs untrained dt_emb 的 NVE 分布完全不重叠（在 35K+ 限定下）。\n      1.5x 是 Youden index 最大化点。论文中以此作为 \"simple, robust diagnostic criterion\"\n      不需要 complex statistical machinery——binary threshold 已足够。\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_050\"\n    description: \"非 locomotion 环境 baseline——拓宽任务类型覆盖\"\n    expected_results:\n      mean_eval_final: 780\n      cross_seed_std: 25\n      ve_stable: 0.70\n      convergence_step: 80000\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cartpole Swingup 是 DMC 中典型的 non-locomotion sparse-reward 任务。\n      DreamerV3 在此任务通常达到 ~780-850 eval return。\n      V/E ratio 收敛到 ~0.70 与 locomotion 环境一致——DreamerV3 的 value calibration \n      是 architecture property 而非 task-specific。\n      作为第三个环境（Walker + Cheetah + Cartpole），增加 generalization 说服力，\n      但更重要的是验证 CIVO 不限于 locomotion（locomotion 的 observation 结构特殊——\n      Cartpole 验证 CIVO 是 dt-conditioning 的通用漏洞）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cartpole baseline 3-seed\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_peak\", \"eval_final\", \"ve_stable\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1\", \"810\", \"790\", \"0.71\"]\n          - [\"2\", \"780\", \"770\", \"0.69\"]\n          - [\"3\", \"820\", \"780\", \"0.70\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cartpole learning curve: 3 seeds + shaded band\"\n    analysis: >\n      Non-locomotion environment baseline 稳定。\n      Low cross-seed variance (std/mean < 4%) 提供干净参照。\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_051\"\n    description: \"非 locomotion 环境 CIVO 触发——验证机制不限于 locomotion\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_nve_peak: 6.5\n      seed2_nve_peak: 4.8\n      seed3_nve_peak: 3.2\n      all_exceed_1_5x: true\n      collapse_rate: 0.67\n      mean_eval_final: 180\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cartpole 的 observation space 更简单（5D vs Walker 24D），\n      RSSM fidelity gap 可能较小 → NVE peak 比 Walker (4.12) 和 Cheetah (14.59) 更温和。\n      但 CIVO 机制不依赖 observation 复杂度——只要 trained dt_emb 存在且有 dt>1 training data，\n      reward gap 就会产生 systematic value bias。\n      3/3 超过 1.5x 阈值（CIVO 必然触发），2/3 崩溃（collapse 仍是 stochastic）。\n      NVE peaks 3.2-6.5x 反映 Cartpole 较小的 fidelity gap。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cartpole CIVO trigger\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"NVE peak\", \"collapse\", \"eval_final\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1\", \"6.5\", \"YES\", \"85\"]\n          - [\"2\", \"4.8\", \"YES\", \"120\"]\n          - [\"3\", \"3.2\", \"NO (self-correct)\", \"350\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cartpole NVE trajectory: 3 seeds, 1.5x threshold line\"\n    analysis: >\n      CIVO 在 non-locomotion 中同样触发，确认它是 dt-conditioning 的通用漏洞。\n      NVE 峰值较低 (3-7x vs Cheetah 8-15x) 与较小的 fidelity gap 一致。\n      如果 Cartpole 也成功复现 → environments_with_clean_replication = 3，达到 best 档上限。\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_052\"\n    description: \"非 locomotion 因果控制——第三环境确认 dt_emb 是 necessary condition\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_nve_peak: 0.85\n      seed2_nve_peak: 1.05\n      seed3_nve_peak: 0.95\n      all_below_1_5x: true\n      collapse_rate: 0.0\n      mean_eval_final: 420\n    result_rationale: >\n      与 Walker 008f 和 Cheetah 022 相同逻辑：去掉 dt_emb → CIVO 环路断开。\n      Cartpole 的 NVE peaks 0.85-1.05（比 locomotion 更接近 1.0 因为 simpler dynamics\n      使 no-dt_emb model 的 reward prediction 退化更小）。\n      0/3 collapse → 第三环境的 perfect causal separation。\n      总计：18 个数据点（3 env × 3 trained + 3 env × 3 untrained），\n      threshold accuracy = 18/18 = 100% → nve_threshold_classification_accuracy = 1.0。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cartpole causal control\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"NVE peak\", \"collapse\", \"eval_final\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1\", \"0.85\", \"NO\", \"450\"]\n          - [\"2\", \"1.05\", \"NO\", \"400\"]\n          - [\"3\", \"0.95\", \"NO\", \"410\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cartpole: trained vs no_dt_emb NVE comparison\"\n    analysis: >\n      三环境因果分离完成。NVE 1.5x 阈值跨 18 个数据点保持 100% 分类精度。\n      这是论文最 robust 的定量贡献——simple binary threshold, perfect classification, 3 environments.\n\n  - name: \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_060\"\n    description: \"基于 RSSM prediction uncertainty 截断 imagination rollout 的可行性验证\"\n    expected_results:\n      truncation_reduces_nve: true\n      nve_peak_with_truncation: 1.8\n      eval_105K: 550\n      vs_baseline: -42%\n      vs_008d_improvement: \"+400% (550 vs 83)\"\n      truncation_frequency: \"35% of rollouts truncated at step 3-5 of H=8\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      当 RSSM prediction uncertainty 超过阈值时截断 imagination → \n      限制 dt>1 states 的 unreliable value targets 对 critic 的影响。\n      应降低 NVE (从 008d 的 4.12x 降到 1.8x)，但不消除（因为 truncation 前的 steps \n      仍有 bias）。性能改善显著但非完美——这是\"engineering mitigation\"而非\"根本解决方案\"。\n      作为论文的 Section 6 (Implications) 中的\"potential safeguard\"之一，\n      pilot 级别足够——不需要是主要贡献。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Truncation pilot vs baselines\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"NVE peak\", \"eval@105K\", \"collapse\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"008d (no truncation)\", \"4.12\", \"83\", \"YES\"]\n          - [\"060 (uncertainty-gated)\", \"1.8\", \"550\", \"NO\"]\n          - [\"baseline (dt=1)\", \"-\", \"916\", \"NO\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Single panel: NVE trajectory with truncation ON vs OFF\"\n    analysis: >\n      Truncation 将 NVE 压到 1.8x（仍略超 1.5x 阈值但不崩溃——sustained duration 短）。\n      证明 RSSM uncertainty 可作为 early warning signal，但 full solution 需要\n      根本性地解决 dt>1 fidelity gap（e.g., hierarchical models like THICK/Hieros）。\n\n  - name: \"018v2 Full-SGS 确认消除 CIVO\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_018v2\"\n    description: \"Full Stop-Gradient Surgery: 移除 observation decoder→dt_emb 梯度（93% 梯度源），验证 CIVO 彻底消除\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_105K: 448.3\n      vs_baseline: -51%\n      nve_sustained_max: 0.72\n      nve_mean: 0.55\n      nve_never_exceeds_1_1x: true\n      civo_eliminated: true\n      performance_cost: \"inherent, not CIVO-driven\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档核心假设 #3：\"018v2 最终确认 NVE ≤ 1.1×\"。\n      Full-SGS 切断 dt_emb 的 93% 梯度源（observation decoders），仅保留 7% KL 梯度。\n      dt_emb 基本不训练 → 等效于 frozen embedding → CIVO 环路完全断开。\n      NVE 持续在 0.5-0.72 范围（与 015b frozen 的 0.39-0.47 一致，略高因为 7% KL 梯度\n      允许微弱训练）。NVE 从不超过 1.1x → 满足 best 档要求。\n      Eval 448.3 (49% baseline) 反映\"inherent cost of multi-dt training without proper \n      temporal abstraction\"——这是 C5 的体现，不是 CIVO。\n      CIVO 独立贡献量化：008d 86% degradation vs 018v2 51% degradation → CIVO 贡献 35pp。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"CIVO decomposition\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"eval@105K\", \"vs_baseline\", \"NVE\", \"degradation_source\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"baseline\", \"916\", \"0%\", \"0.66\", \"-\"]\n          - [\"018v2 (Full-SGS)\", \"448\", \"-51%\", \"0.72\", \"inherent multi-dt cost only\"]\n          - [\"008d (trained dt_emb)\", \"83\", \"-91%\", \"4.12→collapse\", \"inherent + CIVO\"]\n          - [\"CIVO contribution\", \"-\", \"35pp\", \"-\", \"008d_degrad(91%) - 018v2_degrad(51%) = 35pp + collapse\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar: total degradation decomposed into inherent cost (51pp) + CIVO contribution (35pp + collapse)\"\n    analysis: >\n      CIVO 独立贡献 35pp 作为量化结果有力——不是模糊的\"causes degradation\"而是精确的\"adds 35pp \n      degradation on top of inherent cost, plus stochastic catastrophic collapse\"。\n      civo_independent_contribution_pp = 35，落入 best 档 [30, 40] 范围。\n      Full-SGS 作为验证工具（不是推荐方案）彻底闭合了 CIVO 因果链。\n\n  - name: \"exp_020 vanilla baseline 排除 confound\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_020_vanilla\"\n    description: \"纯净 DreamerV3 (无任何 dt 修改) baseline seed 2，排除代码/环境 confound\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_final_500K: 940\n      vs_exp_001: \"+/-2%\"\n      ve_stable: 0.70\n      convergence_identical: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档核心假设 #4：\"exp_020 vanilla baseline 与 exp_001 一致\"。\n      exp_001 使用了添加了 dt_embedding 代码但 dt=1 的配置。\n      exp_020 使用完全 vanilla DreamerV3（无任何 dt 修改）。\n      如果两者一致 → dt=1 下 dt_embedding 代码的存在不引入 confound。\n      预期 eval 940 (vs exp_001 的 950.9 last10 mean)，差异 <2%（在 seed 方差内）。\n      V/E 收敛到 0.70 与 exp_001 的 0.69-0.72 一致。\n      这排除了\"性能差异源于代码修改本身\"的审稿顾虑。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Vanilla vs modified baseline comparison\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"exp_001 (dt_emb code, dt=1)\", \"exp_020 (vanilla)\", \"delta\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"eval_peak\", \"970.4\", \"965\", \"-0.6%\"]\n          - [\"eval_last10_mean\", \"950.9\", \"940\", \"-1.1%\"]\n          - [\"ve_stable\", \"0.69-0.72\", \"0.69-0.71\", \"identical\"]\n          - [\"convergence_step\", \"~135K\", \"~130K\", \"~same\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Two overlapping learning curves: exp_001 vs exp_020\"\n    analysis: >\n      <2% 差异在 single-seed variance 内。确认 dt_embedding 代码在 dt=1 时是 no-op，\n      所有性能差异确实来自 dt>1 配置变化而非代码 artifact。\n\n  - name: \"008f_s3 第三独立 seed 确认\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008f_s3\"\n    description: \"dt_embed_dim=0 的第三个独立 seed，确认 NVE protection 的 robustness\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_105K: 380\n      nve_peak: 1.15\n      nve_105K: 0.55\n      collapse: false\n      below_1_5x: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档核心假设 #2：\"008f_s3 NVE < 1.5×\"。\n      已有 seed 1 (NVE peak 1.02) 和 seed 2 (NVE peak 1.26)，\n      第三 seed 预期 NVE peak ~1.15（在 1.0-1.3 范围内）。\n      dt_embed_dim=0 的保护是结构性的（完全移除 dt conditioning channel），\n      不应有 seed 能突破 1.5x——因为 CIVO 环路的必要组件（dt_emb）完全不存在。\n      Eval 380 落在 seed 1 (503) 和 seed 2 (148) 之间——高方差是 008f 配置的特征\n      （reward noise 导致 learning signal 含噪，性能波动大）。\n      但关键指标 NVE < 1.5x 应 3/3 一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008f all-seed NVE summary\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"NVE peak\", \"eval@105K\", \"collapse\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"seed 1\", \"1.02\", \"503\", \"NO\"]\n          - [\"seed 2\", \"1.26\", \"148\", \"NO\"]\n          - [\"seed 3\", \"1.15\", \"380\", \"NO\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"008f 3-seed NVE trajectory with 1.5x ceiling highlighted\"\n    analysis: >\n      3/3 seeds 低于 1.5x 进一步巩固因果控制。\n      bootstrap_exceedance_pct (trained > untrained): \n      所有 trained seeds 的 NVE peak 分布 vs untrained seeds 的 NVE peak 分布 → \n      exceedance 100%（0% overlap），满足 best 档 [95, 100] 范围。\n\n  - name: \"Bootstrap CI and exceedance analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_034_bootstrap\"\n    description: \"Bootstrap 置信区间量化 trained vs untrained Δ NVE 的统计显著性\"\n    expected_results:\n      delta_nve_mean: 2.29\n      delta_nve_ci_lower: 0.91\n      delta_nve_ci_upper: 3.10\n      ci_excludes_zero: true\n      exceedance_pct_trained_over_untrained: 100\n      exceedance_pct_untrained_over_trained: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档要求 bootstrap_ci_delta_nve_lower_bound ∈ [0.5, 1.5] 和 exceedance_pct ∈ [95, 100]。\n      从现有数据：trained NVE peaks = {4.12, 2.09, 2.05, 1.62, 14.59} (mean ~4.9)；\n      untrained NVE peaks = {1.02, 1.26, 0.93, 0.47, 1.15} (mean ~0.97)。\n      Δ mean = 3.93，但 bootstrap 10000 次重采样的 95% CI lower bound\n      受小样本限制，估计为 0.91（受单个高值 14.59 的影响 CI 较宽）。\n      如果去掉 Cheetah outlier，Walker-only Δ NVE mean = 2.29，CI [0.91, 3.10]。\n      Exceedance: P(random trained > random untrained) = 100%（分布完全不重叠）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Bootstrap inference\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"value\", \"best tier range\", \"status\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Δ NVE mean (Walker)\", \"2.29\", \"-\", \"✓\"]\n          - [\"95% CI lower bound\", \"0.91\", \"[0.5, 1.5]\", \"✓ (within)\"]\n          - [\"95% CI upper bound\", \"3.10\", \"-\", \"-\"]\n          - [\"Exceedance %\", \"100%\", \"[95, 100]\", \"✓\"]\n          - [\"N trained\", \"5\", \"-\", \"-\"]\n          - [\"N untrained\", \"5\", \"-\", \"-\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bootstrap distribution histogram of Δ NVE with 95% CI shaded\"\n    analysis: >\n      CI lower bound 0.91 > 0 → statistically significant separation at α=0.05。\n      Exceedance 100% → no overlap between groups。\n      Small sample (n=5 per group) limits CI tightness，但完美 separation 使结论 robust。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41989,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41989},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"08bdb50e-1069-4ff6-8dd1-d71d2e122e57","uuid":"648d5976-18a6-4b01-97bd-e259341619b3"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":376729,"duration_api_ms":381412,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立——CIVO 是 imagination-based actor-critic 中 dt-conditioning 的架构特异性漏洞。\n  所有待定实验确认因果链；Cheetah 控制实验干净复现；NVE 阈值保持完美分类；CIVO 分解 + TAWM 对比构成清晰 novelty。\n  Claims C1-C5 原样保留，C6 以 dual-pathway 形式呈现反而增加深度。\n  主 selling point：首次系统性因果诊断 + 量化 CIVO 贡献 + 揭示 MPC/imagination 范式差异。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"用 2 个额外 seed 复现 trained dt_emb 触发 CIVO 崩溃的现象\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_peak: 170\n      seed1_eval_collapse: 83\n      seed1_nve_peak: 4.12\n      seed1_nve_sustained_above_1_5x: true\n      seed1_collapse: true\n      seed2_eval_final_105K: 268\n      seed2_nve_peak: 2.05\n      seed2_nve_transient: true\n      seed2_self_correction: true\n      seed2_collapse: false\n      collapse_rate: 0.5\n      nve_exceeds_1_5x_rate: 1.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档要求 walker_trained_dt_emb_collapse_rate 在 [0.33, 0.67]。\n      Trained dt_emb 通过 observation decoder 梯度学会精确 dt 预测，但 RSSM 在 dt>1 时 reward gap=2.78x，\n      系统性地让 critic 高估 dt>1 imagination rollout 的价值。\n      所有 trained dt_emb seed 都应超过 NVE 1.5x（因果机制一致），\n      但崩溃是否锁定取决于 early training stochasticity：\n      初始化和数据采样顺序决定 overestimation feedback loop 是否在 correction 力量压制前锁定。\n      1/2 崩溃率正是这种\"必要但非充分\"模式的体现——NVE>1.5x 是可靠诊断标志，崩溃是随机后果。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008d multi-seed NVE trajectory\"\n        columns: [\"step\", \"seed0_nve\", \"seed1_nve\", \"seed2_nve\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"25K\", \"1.78\", \"1.78\", \"2.05\"]\n          - [\"35K\", \"1.71\", \"1.71\", \"1.24\"]\n          - [\"45K\", \"2.09\", \"2.09\", \"1.62\"]\n          - [\"55K\", \"4.12\", \"4.12\", \"1.41\"]\n          - [\"65K\", \"-\", \"1.23\", \"0.94\"]\n          - [\"105K\", \"-\", \"1.57\", \"0.38\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"NVE trajectory 三 seed 叠加图：seed 0/1 sustained >1.5x → collapse；seed 2 transient >1.5x → self-correction\"\n    analysis: >\n      2/2 seeds 超过 NVE 1.5x 阈值（100% 触发率），但仅 1/2 实际崩溃（50% 崩溃率）。\n      NVE>1.5x 作为 trained dt_emb 的诊断标志达到完美灵敏度。\n      崩溃的随机性源于 primacy bias (Qiao et al. 2023)——early outlier experiences 决定 feedback loop 是否锁定。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"复现因果控制实验——去掉 dt_embedding 后 NVE 保持健康\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 503\n      seed1_nve_peak: 1.02\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.30\n      seed2_eval_peak: 359\n      seed2_eval_105K: 148\n      seed2_nve_peak: 1.26\n      seed2_nve_105K: 1.14\n      both_seeds_nve_below_1_5x: true\n      recovery_pattern: \"seed 1 zigzag recovery; seed 2 decline after 75K but NVE stays below threshold\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      去掉 dt_embed_dim=0 后，reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2（reward gap 仅 1.01x），\n      CIVO 的正反馈环路从根本上被切断——critic 无法利用精确 dt 信息进行系统性高估。\n      两个 seed 的 NVE 都不会超过 1.5x（实际 peak 分别为 1.02x 和 1.26x），\n      但去掉 dt_embedding 的 trade-off 是 reward_MAE=0.747（baseline 75x），\n      导致 reward 信号含噪，eval 轨迹高方差（seed 2 在 75K 后 decline 到 148）。\n      这是因果控制实验——证明\"去掉 → 不崩\"，而非推荐方案。\n      关键：即使 seed 2 表现差（148@105K），NVE 仍仅 1.14x，远低于 trained dt_emb 的 2.09x。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008f vs 008d NVE 对比（因果分离）\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"config\", \"nve_peak\", \"nve_105K\", \"collapse\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"seed 0\", \"008d (trained)\", \"2.09\", \"collapsed@55K\", \"YES\"]\n          - [\"seed 0\", \"008f (no dt_emb)\", \"1.02\", \"0.30\", \"NO\"]\n          - [\"seed 1\", \"009e (trained)\", \"4.12\", \"1.57\", \"YES\"]\n          - [\"seed 1\", \"009f (no dt_emb)\", \"1.02\", \"0.30\", \"NO\"]\n          - [\"seed 2\", \"009b (trained)\", \"2.05\", \"0.38 (self-correct)\", \"NO\"]\n          - [\"seed 2\", \"009c (no dt_emb)\", \"1.26\", \"1.14\", \"NO\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"NVE 6 条线对比图：trained (红, 3 seeds) vs no_dt_emb (蓝, 3 seeds)，清晰分离带\"\n    analysis: >\n      NVE 1.5x 阈值在扩展到 6 个数据点后仍保持完美分类：\n      trained 3/3 超过 1.5x，no_dt_emb 0/3 超过 1.5x → 分类精度 100%。\n      这是论文最强的定量结果——简单阈值实现完美因果分离。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: \"dt=1 imagination 多 seed 验证——预期揭示 dual-pathway vulnerability\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 869.9\n      seed1_nve_105K: 0.80\n      seed1_collapse: false\n      seed2_eval_105K: 137\n      seed2_nve_105K: 3.78\n      seed2_collapse: true\n      seed2_collapse_pathway: \"non-CIVO (eval-driven, entropy↑)\"\n      collapse_rate: 0.5\n      gate_dt_1_frac_both_seeds: 1.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      dt=1 imagination 消除 Pathway A (经典 CIVO: dt>1 rollout 中 RSSM fidelity gap 导致 value explosion)。\n      但 trained dt_embedding 仍通过 training data 中的 dt>1 transitions 影响 critic 训练——\n      即使 imagination 不使用 dt>1，critic 仍在 real data 的 dt=2 transitions 上训练，\n      dt_emb 的 93% 梯度来自 observation decoders 使其学到 dt-specific representations。\n      Pathway B (non-CIVO policy instability)：当 critic 对 dt>1 real transitions 的估值偏差\n      通过 Bellman backup 传播到 dt=1 状态时，policy 变得不稳定（entropy↑ 而非↓），\n      eval 先崩（policy 随机化）→ NVE 被动升高（分母缩小）。\n      50% 崩溃率与 008d 相同说明 dt=1 imagination 未降低风险——\n      vulnerability 的根源是 trained dt_embedding 本身，不是 imagination 步长。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008e_v3 dual-pathway dynamics\"\n        columns: [\"feature\", \"seed 1 (healthy)\", \"seed 2 (Pathway B collapse)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"value change 85K→105K\", \"stable (351→458, +30%)\", \"stable (339→340, +0.3%)\"]\n          - [\"eval change 85K→105K\", \"657→870 (+32%)\", \"715→137 (-81%)\"]\n          - [\"NVE driver\", \"N/A (healthy)\", \"eval denominator crash\"]\n          - [\"actor_entropy 85K→105K\", \"-5.21→-5.10 (stable)\", \"-5.21→-3.83 (destabilizing)\"]\n          - [\"mechanism\", \"N/A\", \"policy instability → eval crash → NVE passive rise\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dual panel: seed 1 vs seed 2 learning curves + actor_entropy + NVE，标注 Pathway A vs B 特征\"\n    analysis: >\n      C6 partially falsified 是论文的意外亮点——\"trained dt_embedding creates vulnerability \n      through multiple pathways\" 比原来的\"dt=1 fixes it\"更深刻。\n      Pathway A (CIVO) 需要 dt>1 imagination；Pathway B (policy instability) 独立于 imagination dt。\n      这解释了为什么 surface-level fixes 不够，推动了对 hierarchical approaches (THICK, Hieros) 的论证。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"复现 untrained dt_emb 的 value growth suppression + V-recovery 模式\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_105K: 720\n      seed1_nve_range: [0.55, 0.90]\n      seed1_recovery_cycles: 2\n      seed2_eval_105K: 690\n      seed2_nve_range: [0.50, 0.85]\n      seed2_recovery_cycles: 1\n      cross_seed_collapse_rate: 0.0\n      vs_baseline_range: [-20%, -10%]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Untrained dt_embedding 是随机固定向量——critic 无法从中提取有用的 dt 信息，\n      因此无法对 dt>1 states 产生系统性高估。NVE 被结构性压制在 baseline 水平以下（0.5-0.9x）。\n      V-recovery 模式源于：没有 trained dt_emb 放大 overestimation，\n      actor 的错误策略（从 dt>1 data 学到的次优行为）仍可通过 real environment returns 纠正——\n      correction 力量不会被 critic overestimation 压制。\n      额外 seed 应复现此模式因为机制是结构性的（dt_emb 不训练 → 信息阻断），\n      而非依赖 stochastic 初始化。性能略低于 baseline (-10~-20%) 因为 subsample OFF 但 dt>1 \n      transitions 仍存在 RSSM error，actor 需要周期性\"unlearn\"错误策略。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008a multi-seed normalized v/e\"\n        columns: [\"step\", \"seed0\", \"seed1\", \"seed2\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"55K\", \"0.93\", \"0.88\", \"0.82\"]\n          - [\"65K\", \"0.66\", \"0.72\", \"0.68\"]\n          - [\"75K\", \"0.75\", \"0.70\", \"0.65\"]\n          - [\"85K\", \"0.68\", \"0.62\", \"0.58\"]\n          - [\"95K\", \"0.79\", \"0.75\", \"0.70\"]\n          - [\"105K\", \"0.59\", \"0.55\", \"0.52\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-seed NVE band plot: shaded region 0.5-0.93x，对比 trained dt_emb 的 1.5-4x\"\n    analysis: >\n      C3 cross-seed 一致性强化——structural suppression 不依赖 seed。\n      NVE 的逐步下降趋势（从 0.9x 到 0.5x over 50K steps）表明抑制效果随训练加强而非衰减。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: \"冻结 dt_embedding (requires_grad=False) 验证 TRAINING 是 CIVO 必要条件\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_105K: 204\n      nve_peak: 0.47\n      nve_sustained: [0.39, 0.47]\n      collapse: false\n      gradient_starvation: true\n      actor_loss_near_zero: true\n      gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Frozen dt_emb (random, requires_grad=False) 完全阻断 CIVO：\n      dt_emb 不训练 → 不会学到 dt-specific representations → reward head 和 observation decoder\n      无法利用 dt 信息产生系统性偏差 → critic 无法系统性高估 dt>1 states。\n      NVE 0.39-0.47 远低于 1.0（critic UNDER-estimates），原因是 frozen random embedding\n      注入噪声到 RSSM，干扰 state prediction 质量。\n      但出现新问题：gradient starvation——frozen embedding 作为常量噪声使 actor gradient\n      信号减弱（actor_loss → 0），导致性能停滞在 ~200（baseline 22%）。\n      这不是 CIVO 崩溃，而是不同失败模式（信息瓶颈），进一步确认：\n      dt_emb 的 TRAINING（而非 presence）才是 CIVO 的 necessary condition。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"2×2 dt_emb 消融矩阵\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"dt_emb state\", \"NVE peak\", \"collapse\", \"failure mode\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"008d\", \"trained\", \"4.12\", \"YES (1/2)\", \"CIVO → value explosion\"]\n          - [\"008f\", \"absent (dim=0)\", \"1.26\", \"NO\", \"reward noise (MAE 75x)\"]\n          - [\"015b\", \"frozen (random)\", \"0.47\", \"NO\", \"gradient starvation\"]\n          - [\"008a\", \"trained (unexposed)\", \"0.93\", \"NO\", \"mild V-recovery\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: NVE peak across 4 dt_emb conditions，1.5x threshold line\"\n    analysis: >\n      三种非 CIVO 失败模式（reward noise, gradient starvation, mild degradation）都不触发 NVE>1.5x。\n      只有 actively trained dt_emb exposed to dt>1 data 才触发 CIVO。\n      2×2 matrix: {trained vs not} × {exposed to dt>1 vs not} 清晰表明 BOTH training AND exposure 是必要条件。\n\n  - name: \"Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_016\"\n    description: \"窄化 dt=1 imagination 下 non-CIVO 崩溃率的置信区间\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed3_collapse: false\n      seed3_eval_105K: 820\n      seed3_nve_105K: 0.75\n      seed4_collapse: true\n      seed4_eval_105K: 185\n      seed4_nve_105K: 2.90\n      seed4_pathway: \"Pathway B (eval-driven)\"\n      total_collapse_rate_4seeds: 0.5\n      ci_95_collapse_rate: [0.15, 0.85]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 collapse rate 稳定在 ~50%（与 008d 的 dt=2 imagination 相同）。\n      这是关键发现——dt=1 imagination 不降低崩溃概率，说明 vulnerability 根源在 trained dt_embedding\n      而非 imagination 步长。2/4 seeds 崩溃给出 Clopper-Pearson 95% CI [0.15, 0.85]，\n      中位估计 0.5 与 008d 一致。崩溃的 seed 都表现 Pathway B 特征（entropy↑, eval-driven），\n      而非 Pathway A (CIVO)——dt=1 imagination 成功消除了 Pathway A 但暴露了 Pathway B。\n      Healthy seed 的 eval 比 baseline 略低（820-870 vs 916）可能源于 subsample ON 的 learning signal 减少。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008e_v3 all-seed collapse summary\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval@105K\", \"NVE@105K\", \"collapse\", \"pathway\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"seed 1 (original)\", \"870\", \"0.80\", \"NO\", \"-\"]\n          - [\"seed 2\", \"137\", \"3.78\", \"YES\", \"Pathway B\"]\n          - [\"seed 3\", \"820\", \"0.75\", \"NO\", \"-\"]\n          - [\"seed 4\", \"185\", \"2.90\", \"YES\", \"Pathway B\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4-seed eval trajectory fan chart，collapsed seeds 标红，healthy 标绿\"\n    analysis: >\n      50% collapse rate (2/4) 是 dual-pathway vulnerability 的强证据。\n      Pathway B 的 reproducibility 说明它不是 outlier——是 trained dt_embedding 的系统性后果。\n      论文表述：\"even restricting imagination to dt=1 does not eliminate the vulnerability \n      created by training a dt-embedding; collapse probability remains ~50%.\"\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_020\"\n    description: \"第二个 DMC 环境的 dt=1 baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_eval_peak: 849.8\n      seed1_eval_final: 849.8\n      seed2_eval_peak: 820\n      seed2_eval_final: 810\n      seed3_eval_peak: 860\n      seed3_eval_final: 840\n      cross_seed_mean_final: 833\n      cross_seed_std_final: 20\n      ve_stable_range: [0.65, 0.72]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cheetah Run 是标准 DMC locomotion 任务，DreamerV3 在此环境表现稳定。\n      已有 exp_010a 的 seed 1 达到 849.8 peak，额外 seed 应在 ±5% 范围内。\n      V/E ratio 稳定在 0.65-0.72（与 Walker Walk 一致），确认 value calibration \n      在不同环境间具有一致性——这是 NVE 阈值跨环境泛化的前提条件。\n      3 seed 的低方差（std ~20/833 = 2.4%）确认 baseline 稳定，\n      为后续 CIVO trigger 实验提供干净参照。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cheetah Run baseline 3-seed summary\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_peak\", \"eval_final\", \"ve_stable\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"seed 1 (010a)\", \"849.8\", \"849.8\", \"0.68\"]\n          - [\"seed 2\", \"820\", \"810\", \"0.66\"]\n          - [\"seed 3\", \"860\", \"840\", \"0.70\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-seed learning curves with shaded IQM confidence band\"\n    analysis: >\n      Baseline 跨 seed 高度一致（IQR < 5%），为 CIVO 检测提供低噪声参照。\n      这是 CoRL 审稿的基本要求——R1 (单环境) 被 Cheetah 复现直接回应。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_021\"\n    description: \"跨环境复现 CIVO collapse——关键假设验证\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_nve_peak: 14.59\n      seed1_collapse: true\n      seed1_collapse_step: 55000\n      seed2_nve_peak: 12.0\n      seed2_collapse: true\n      seed2_collapse_step: 65000\n      seed3_nve_peak: 8.5\n      seed3_collapse: false\n      seed3_self_correction: true\n      cross_seed_nve_exceeds_1_5x: 3\n      collapse_rate: 0.67\n      cheetah_civo_trigger_nve_peak_range: [8.5, 14.59]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档要求 cheetah_civo_trigger_nve_peak 在 [10.0, 18.0]。\n      已有 exp_010b (seed 1) 达到 NVE 14.59x 并崩溃。\n      Cheetah 的 CIVO 比 Walker 更剧烈原因：Cheetah 的 observation space 更高维（velocity-dominant），\n      RSSM 在 dt>1 时的 obs prediction error 更大，dt_emb 的 93% observation decoder 梯度\n      更强烈地将 dt-specific bias encode 到 embedding 中。\n      3/3 seeds 应超过 NVE 1.5x（100% 触发率），2/3 崩溃（collapse_rate ~0.67，\n      Walker 的 0.5 在 Cheetah 中可能更高因为 fidelity gap 更大）。\n      NVE peak 在 8.5-14.59 范围内，落入 best 档的 [10, 18] 区间。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cheetah CIVO trigger NVE trajectory\"\n        columns: [\"step\", \"seed1_nve\", \"seed2_nve\", \"seed3_nve\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"25K\", \"1.9\", \"1.7\", \"1.5\"]\n          - [\"35K\", \"3.2\", \"2.8\", \"2.1\"]\n          - [\"45K\", \"5.8\", \"4.5\", \"3.8\"]\n          - [\"55K\", \"9.1\", \"7.2\", \"5.5\"]\n          - [\"65K\", \"14.59\", \"12.0\", \"8.5\"]\n          - [\"75K\", \"collapsed\", \"collapsed\", \"6.2\"]\n          - [\"85K\", \"-\", \"-\", \"4.1\"]\n          - [\"95K\", \"-\", \"-\", \"2.8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cheetah NVE trajectory: 3 seeds with collapse markers, 1.5x threshold highlighted\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨环境 CIVO 复现是论文最关键的 gap closure。\n      Cheetah 的更剧烈 NVE (14.59x vs Walker 4.12x) 来自更大的 obs fidelity gap，\n      提供了 C4 (longer dt amplifies) 的间接支持——更复杂的 dynamics → 更大的 dt>1 预测误差 → 更强 CIVO。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_022\"\n    description: \"跨环境因果控制——去掉 dt_embedding 阻断 CIVO\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_nve_peak: 0.95\n      seed2_nve_peak: 1.10\n      seed3_nve_peak: 1.20\n      all_seeds_below_1_5x: true\n      mean_eval_105K: 280\n      vs_baseline: -66%\n      collapse_rate: 0.0\n      cheetah_control_nve_peak: 1.20\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档核心假设 #1：\"Cheetah dt_embed_dim=0 控制实验 NVE < 1.5×\"。\n      机制与 Walker 008f 相同：去掉 dt_embedding → reward head 无法区分 dt=1/dt=2\n      → CIVO 正反馈环路被切断。\n      NVE peak 预期 0.95-1.20（落入 best 档 [0.3, 1.3]）。\n      Eval 性能低（~280 vs baseline 833, -66%）因为与 Walker 008f 相同的 trade-off：\n      reward_MAE 显著升高，reward 信号含噪。\n      但关键对比是 NVE：021 的 3/3 seeds 超过 1.5x vs 022 的 0/3 seeds 超过 1.5x →\n      跨环境 6/6 perfect classification（加上 Walker 的 6/6 = 总计 12/12）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cheetah 因果分离：trained vs no_dt_emb\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"seed\", \"NVE peak\", \"collapse\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"021 (trained)\", \"1\", \"14.59\", \"YES\"]\n          - [\"021 (trained)\", \"2\", \"12.0\", \"YES\"]\n          - [\"021 (trained)\", \"3\", \"8.5\", \"NO (self-correct)\"]\n          - [\"022 (no dt_emb)\", \"1\", \"0.95\", \"NO\"]\n          - [\"022 (no dt_emb)\", \"2\", \"1.10\", \"NO\"]\n          - [\"022 (no dt_emb)\", \"3\", \"1.20\", \"NO\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cheetah NVE comparison: 6 lines, clear separation band at 1.5x\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨环境因果控制成功复现：environments_with_clean_replication = 2 (Walker + Cheetah)，\n      满足 best 档 [2, 3] 要求。12/12 NVE threshold classification → accuracy 100%。\n      这是回应 R1 (单环境) 的核心证据。\n\n  - name: \"Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_023\"\n    description: \"跨环境 C3 验证——untrained dt_emb 的 value suppression 在 Cheetah 中复现\"\n    expected_results:\n      mean_eval_105K: 620\n      vs_baseline: -25%\n      nve_range: [0.45, 0.85]\n      recovery_cycles: 1.5\n      collapse_rate: 0.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Untrained dt_emb 的保护机制是结构性的（information blockade），应跨环境一致。\n      Cheetah 的 V-recovery 可能不如 Walker 显著（-25% vs Walker -15%）因为 Cheetah \n      dynamics 更复杂，untrained dt_emb 的噪声对 RSSM state prediction 干扰更大。\n      NVE 一致性保持在 0.45-0.85x（suppressed below baseline），0/3 seeds 崩溃。\n      这完成了 C3 的跨环境验证——untrained dt_emb 的 value growth suppression \n      不是 Walker-specific 现象。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"C3 cross-environment NVE suppression\"\n        columns: [\"environment\", \"config\", \"NVE range\", \"vs_baseline\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Walker\", \"008a (untrained, H=15)\", \"0.59-0.93\", \"-15%\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah\", \"023 (untrained, H=15)\", \"0.45-0.85\", \"-25%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-environment NVE suppression band: Walker vs Cheetah, both below 1.0x\"\n    analysis: >\n      C3 跨环境一致确认 untrained dt_emb 的保护是 architecture-level property，\n      不是 environment-specific artifact。性能差异 (-15% vs -25%) 可归因于 Cheetah \n      更高的 observation dimensionality 使 random embedding noise 影响更大。\n\n  - name: \"RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_030\"\n    description: \"量化 RSSM fidelity gap——CIVO 的机制基础\"\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_obs_gap: 2.04\n      008d_obs_gap: 1.30\n      008f_obs_gap: 2.75\n      008d_reward_gap: 2.78\n      008f_reward_gap: 1.01\n      cheetah_baseline_obs_gap: 2.50\n      cheetah_010b_reward_gap: 3.20\n    result_rationale: >\n      已有 Walker 数据（exp_rssm_fidelity_analysis）。扩展到 Cheetah 应显示更大的 fidelity gap\n      因为 Cheetah 的 dynamics 更复杂（高速 locomotion, velocity dominant observations）。\n      Cheetah 的 obs_gap 2.50x (vs Walker 2.04x) 和 reward_gap 3.20x (vs Walker 2.78x)\n      解释了为什么 Cheetah CIVO 更剧烈 (NVE peak 14.59x vs Walker 4.12x)——\n      更大的 fidelity gap → 更大的 systematic value bias → 更快的 positive feedback。\n      RSSM 在 dt>1 时本质上是做更长期的一步预测，prediction error 随 dt 增大而增大\n      符合 latent dynamics model 的基本性质。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-environment RSSM fidelity\"\n        columns: [\"env\", \"model\", \"dt1_obs_MSE\", \"dt2_obs_MSE\", \"obs_gap\", \"reward_gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Walker\", \"baseline\", \"13.49\", \"27.50\", \"2.04x\", \"1.56x\"]\n          - [\"Walker\", \"008d (trained)\", \"41.31\", \"53.67\", \"1.30x\", \"2.78x\"]\n          - [\"Walker\", \"008f (no dt_emb)\", \"8.01\", \"22.04\", \"2.75x\", \"1.01x\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah\", \"baseline\", \"18.2\", \"45.5\", \"2.50x\", \"1.80x\"]\n          - [\"Cheetah\", \"010b (trained)\", \"55.4\", \"68.2\", \"1.23x\", \"3.20x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: obs_MSE × reward_MAE for dt=1 vs dt=2, across models and environments\"\n    analysis: >\n      关键洞察：008d/010b 的低 obs_gap ratio (1.30x/1.23x) 具有误导性——\n      它们的 dt=1 绝对误差已是 baseline 3x（模型整体崩坏），ratio 低是因为分子分母都大。\n      论文必须并排呈现绝对值和 ratio。trained dt_emb 的高 reward_gap (2.78x/3.20x) \n      是 CIVO 的直接机制证据——critic 在 dt>1 时系统性高估 reward。\n\n  - name: \"Actor entropy analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_031\"\n    description: \"区分 Pathway A (CIVO, entropy↓) vs Pathway B (policy instability, entropy↑)\"\n    expected_results:\n      008d_s0_entropy_trend: \"decreasing (-3.47→-4.88, policy over-committing)\"\n      009e_s1_entropy_trend: \"decreasing (-3.5→-4.9)\"\n      008e_v3_s2_entropy_trend: \"increasing (-5.21→-3.83, policy destabilizing)\"\n      baseline_entropy_stable: \"-5.0 to -5.2 (converged)\"\n      008a_entropy: \"stable around -4.5 (slightly higher than baseline)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Actor entropy 是区分两种崩溃 pathway 的关键诊断指标。\n      Pathway A (CIVO): value overestimation → actor exploitation → entropy↓（policy 变确定性地追求\n      被高估的 state sequences）→ actor 锁死在错误策略。\n      Pathway B (non-CIVO): policy instability → entropy↑（policy 失去结构，变得接近随机）\n      → eval 下降 → NVE 被动升高。\n      这两种签名清晰可分，为 dual-pathway 叙事提供了独立的诊断证据。\n      Untrained dt_emb (008a) entropy 略高于 baseline 因为 actor 周期性探索\n      （对应 V-recovery 的 dip phases）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Entropy trajectory comparison\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"entropy@35K\", \"entropy@55K\", \"entropy@85K\", \"entropy@105K\", \"pathway\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"baseline\", \"-3.8\", \"-5.0\", \"-5.1\", \"-5.1\", \"healthy\"]\n          - [\"008d s0 (collapse)\", \"-3.5\", \"-4.9\", \"-\", \"-\", \"A (CIVO)\"]\n          - [\"008e_v3 s2 (collapse)\", \"-3.5\", \"-5.1\", \"-5.2\", \"-3.8\", \"B (instability)\"]\n          - [\"008a (untrained)\", \"-2.8\", \"-4.2\", \"-4.5\", \"-4.5\", \"healthy (suppressed)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Entropy time series: 4 configs overlaid, collapse-type annotations\"\n    analysis: >\n      Entropy divergence 是 Pathway A/B 的 cleanest separator——\n      在 collapse onset 时 entropy 方向相反 (↓ vs ↑) 是定性不同的失败机制的强证据。\n      这支持 \"multiple vulnerability pathways\" 的核心叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_032\"\n    description: \"直接展示 V(s) 与 Monte Carlo return 的偏离分布\"\n    expected_results:\n      008d_bias: \"+45% systematic overestimation at dt>1 states\"\n      008f_bias: \"±15% unbiased noise (no systematic direction)\"\n      baseline_bias: \"+5% mild optimism (normal for DreamerV3)\"\n      008d_distribution_shape: \"right-skewed (heavy positive tail)\"\n      008f_distribution_shape: \"symmetric, wide (noise-dominated)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      V/E ratio 是粗糙代理指标——distribution plot 直接展示偏离的结构。\n      Trained dt_emb (008d) 应显示 systematic positive bias（右偏分布），\n      特别是在 dt>1 states 上——critic 在这些 states 一致性地过高估计。\n      No dt_emb (008f) 应显示对称的宽分布——没有系统性方向，只有噪声。\n      这直接回应 R3 (v/e ratio is crude proxy) 的审稿顾虑。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Violin plot: V(s) - MC_return distribution for baseline/008d/008f, split by dt=1 vs dt=2 states\"\n    analysis: >\n      可视化证据直接 compelling 审稿人——不需要他们相信 ratio 代理足够。\n      008d 在 dt=2 states 的 systematic positive skew 是 CIVO 的\"smoking gun visualization\"。\n\n  - name: \"dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_033\"\n    description: \"分析 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 在训练过程中的分化\"\n    expected_results:\n      initial_cosine_sim: 0.0\n      008d_cosine_sim_35K: 0.15\n      008d_cosine_sim_55K: 0.08\n      008a_cosine_sim_105K: 0.02\n      frozen_cosine_sim: 0.0\n      dt_emb_norm_008d_35K: 2.3\n      dt_emb_norm_008a_105K: 0.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      dt_embedding 初始化为 random → cosine similarity 接近 0。\n      训练过程中 008d 的 dt=1 和 dt=2 embedding 应分化——cosine similarity 保持低\n      但 norm 增大（embedding 获得\"意义\"——不同 dt 映射到不同的高范数向量）。\n      008a (unexposed) 的 embedding 虽然 trainable 但未见过 dt>1 data，\n      norm 应保持接近初始化水平（无训练信号驱动增长）。\n      这提供了 dt_emb TRAINING 如何encode dt-specific information 的直接证据，\n      补充了 gradient decomposition 的分析。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"dt_embedding vector statistics\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"step\", \"||emb_dt1||\", \"||emb_dt2||\", \"cosine(dt1,dt2)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"008d\", \"5K\", \"0.5\", \"0.5\", \"0.02\"]\n          - [\"008d\", \"35K\", \"1.8\", \"2.3\", \"0.15\"]\n          - [\"008d\", \"55K\", \"2.5\", \"3.1\", \"0.08\"]\n          - [\"008a\", \"105K\", \"0.5\", \"0.4\", \"0.01\"]\n          - [\"015b (frozen)\", \"105K\", \"0.5\", \"0.5\", \"0.00\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Embedding norm trajectory + cosine similarity over training\"\n    analysis: >\n      Trained dt_emb 的高 norm + 低 cosine 说明两个 embedding 都\"学到了东西\"但\"学到了不同的东西\"。\n      这直接对应 dt_emb 的 93% 梯度来自 obs decoders——embedding 学到了 dt-specific 的 \n      observation reconstruction bias，而这正是 CIVO 的信息来源。\n\n  - name: \"NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_034\"\n    description: \"系统分析 NVE 阈值的分类精度和 AUROC\"\n    expected_results:\n      threshold_1_3x_accuracy: 0.83\n      threshold_1_5x_accuracy: 1.0\n      threshold_1_7x_accuracy: 1.0\n      threshold_2_0x_accuracy: 0.83\n      auroc: 1.0\n      optimal_threshold: 1.5\n      n_datapoints: 12\n      false_positive_rate_at_1_5x: 0.0\n      false_negative_rate_at_1_5x: 0.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档要求 nve_threshold_classification_accuracy ≥ 90%。\n      从已有数据：trained dt_emb 的 NVE peaks = [4.12, 2.09, 2.05, 1.62, 14.59, ...]\n      vs no dt_emb peaks = [1.02, 1.26, 0.93, 0.47, ...]。\n      在 1.5x 阈值：所有 trained seeds 超过（sensitivity=100%），所有 untrained seeds 不超过（specificity=100%）。\n      1.3x 阈值会产生 false positive（009c@105K=1.14x 仍低于 1.3x，但 009b@25K=2.05x 的 \n      early transient 可能在 25K 时 baseline v/e 不稳定导致误判——但 35K+ 限定后没问题）。\n      2.0x 阈值会漏掉 009b@45K=1.62x（false negative）。\n      1.5x 是最优阈值——在 35K+ 限定下实现完美分类。\n      扩展到 Cheetah 后（3 trained + 3 untrained = 6 点），总 n=12 仍保持 100% accuracy。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"NVE threshold sensitivity\"\n        columns: [\"threshold\", \"true_pos\", \"false_neg\", \"true_neg\", \"false_pos\", \"accuracy\", \"F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1.3x\", \"6/6\", \"0/6\", \"5/6\", \"1/6\", \"0.92\", \"0.92\"]\n          - [\"1.5x\", \"6/6\", \"0/6\", \"6/6\", \"0/6\", \"1.00\", \"1.00\"]\n          - [\"1.7x\", \"5/6\", \"1/6\", \"6/6\", \"0/6\", \"0.92\", \"0.91\"]\n          - [\"2.0x\", \"4/6\", \"2/6\", \"6/6\", \"0/6\", \"0.83\", \"0.80\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ROC curve with threshold markers; shaded optimal region around 1.5x\"\n    analysis: >\n      AUROC=1.0 说明 trained vs untrained dt_emb 的 NVE 分布完全不重叠（在 35K+ 限定下）。\n      1.5x 是 Youden index 最大化点。论文中以此作为 \"simple, robust diagnostic criterion\"\n      不需要 complex statistical machinery——binary threshold 已足够。\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_050\"\n    description: \"非 locomotion 环境 baseline——拓宽任务类型覆盖\"\n    expected_results:\n      mean_eval_final: 780\n      cross_seed_std: 25\n      ve_stable: 0.70\n      convergence_step: 80000\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cartpole Swingup 是 DMC 中典型的 non-locomotion sparse-reward 任务。\n      DreamerV3 在此任务通常达到 ~780-850 eval return。\n      V/E ratio 收敛到 ~0.70 与 locomotion 环境一致——DreamerV3 的 value calibration \n      是 architecture property 而非 task-specific。\n      作为第三个环境（Walker + Cheetah + Cartpole），增加 generalization 说服力，\n      但更重要的是验证 CIVO 不限于 locomotion（locomotion 的 observation 结构特殊——\n      Cartpole 验证 CIVO 是 dt-conditioning 的通用漏洞）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cartpole baseline 3-seed\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"eval_peak\", \"eval_final\", \"ve_stable\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1\", \"810\", \"790\", \"0.71\"]\n          - [\"2\", \"780\", \"770\", \"0.69\"]\n          - [\"3\", \"820\", \"780\", \"0.70\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cartpole learning curve: 3 seeds + shaded band\"\n    analysis: >\n      Non-locomotion environment baseline 稳定。\n      Low cross-seed variance (std/mean < 4%) 提供干净参照。\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_051\"\n    description: \"非 locomotion 环境 CIVO 触发——验证机制不限于 locomotion\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_nve_peak: 6.5\n      seed2_nve_peak: 4.8\n      seed3_nve_peak: 3.2\n      all_exceed_1_5x: true\n      collapse_rate: 0.67\n      mean_eval_final: 180\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cartpole 的 observation space 更简单（5D vs Walker 24D），\n      RSSM fidelity gap 可能较小 → NVE peak 比 Walker (4.12) 和 Cheetah (14.59) 更温和。\n      但 CIVO 机制不依赖 observation 复杂度——只要 trained dt_emb 存在且有 dt>1 training data，\n      reward gap 就会产生 systematic value bias。\n      3/3 超过 1.5x 阈值（CIVO 必然触发），2/3 崩溃（collapse 仍是 stochastic）。\n      NVE peaks 3.2-6.5x 反映 Cartpole 较小的 fidelity gap。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cartpole CIVO trigger\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"NVE peak\", \"collapse\", \"eval_final\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1\", \"6.5\", \"YES\", \"85\"]\n          - [\"2\", \"4.8\", \"YES\", \"120\"]\n          - [\"3\", \"3.2\", \"NO (self-correct)\", \"350\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cartpole NVE trajectory: 3 seeds, 1.5x threshold line\"\n    analysis: >\n      CIVO 在 non-locomotion 中同样触发，确认它是 dt-conditioning 的通用漏洞。\n      NVE 峰值较低 (3-7x vs Cheetah 8-15x) 与较小的 fidelity gap 一致。\n      如果 Cartpole 也成功复现 → environments_with_clean_replication = 3，达到 best 档上限。\n\n  - name: \"Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_052\"\n    description: \"非 locomotion 因果控制——第三环境确认 dt_emb 是 necessary condition\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed1_nve_peak: 0.85\n      seed2_nve_peak: 1.05\n      seed3_nve_peak: 0.95\n      all_below_1_5x: true\n      collapse_rate: 0.0\n      mean_eval_final: 420\n    result_rationale: >\n      与 Walker 008f 和 Cheetah 022 相同逻辑：去掉 dt_emb → CIVO 环路断开。\n      Cartpole 的 NVE peaks 0.85-1.05（比 locomotion 更接近 1.0 因为 simpler dynamics\n      使 no-dt_emb model 的 reward prediction 退化更小）。\n      0/3 collapse → 第三环境的 perfect causal separation。\n      总计：18 个数据点（3 env × 3 trained + 3 env × 3 untrained），\n      threshold accuracy = 18/18 = 100% → nve_threshold_classification_accuracy = 1.0。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cartpole causal control\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"NVE peak\", \"collapse\", \"eval_final\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1\", \"0.85\", \"NO\", \"450\"]\n          - [\"2\", \"1.05\", \"NO\", \"400\"]\n          - [\"3\", \"0.95\", \"NO\", \"410\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cartpole: trained vs no_dt_emb NVE comparison\"\n    analysis: >\n      三环境因果分离完成。NVE 1.5x 阈值跨 18 个数据点保持 100% 分类精度。\n      这是论文最 robust 的定量贡献——simple binary threshold, perfect classification, 3 environments.\n\n  - name: \"Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_060\"\n    description: \"基于 RSSM prediction uncertainty 截断 imagination rollout 的可行性验证\"\n    expected_results:\n      truncation_reduces_nve: true\n      nve_peak_with_truncation: 1.8\n      eval_105K: 550\n      vs_baseline: -42%\n      vs_008d_improvement: \"+400% (550 vs 83)\"\n      truncation_frequency: \"35% of rollouts truncated at step 3-5 of H=8\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      当 RSSM prediction uncertainty 超过阈值时截断 imagination → \n      限制 dt>1 states 的 unreliable value targets 对 critic 的影响。\n      应降低 NVE (从 008d 的 4.12x 降到 1.8x)，但不消除（因为 truncation 前的 steps \n      仍有 bias）。性能改善显著但非完美——这是\"engineering mitigation\"而非\"根本解决方案\"。\n      作为论文的 Section 6 (Implications) 中的\"potential safeguard\"之一，\n      pilot 级别足够——不需要是主要贡献。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Truncation pilot vs baselines\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"NVE peak\", \"eval@105K\", \"collapse\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"008d (no truncation)\", \"4.12\", \"83\", \"YES\"]\n          - [\"060 (uncertainty-gated)\", \"1.8\", \"550\", \"NO\"]\n          - [\"baseline (dt=1)\", \"-\", \"916\", \"NO\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Single panel: NVE trajectory with truncation ON vs OFF\"\n    analysis: >\n      Truncation 将 NVE 压到 1.8x（仍略超 1.5x 阈值但不崩溃——sustained duration 短）。\n      证明 RSSM uncertainty 可作为 early warning signal，但 full solution 需要\n      根本性地解决 dt>1 fidelity gap（e.g., hierarchical models like THICK/Hieros）。\n\n  - name: \"018v2 Full-SGS 确认消除 CIVO\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_018v2\"\n    description: \"Full Stop-Gradient Surgery: 移除 observation decoder→dt_emb 梯度（93% 梯度源），验证 CIVO 彻底消除\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_105K: 448.3\n      vs_baseline: -51%\n      nve_sustained_max: 0.72\n      nve_mean: 0.55\n      nve_never_exceeds_1_1x: true\n      civo_eliminated: true\n      performance_cost: \"inherent, not CIVO-driven\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档核心假设 #3：\"018v2 最终确认 NVE ≤ 1.1×\"。\n      Full-SGS 切断 dt_emb 的 93% 梯度源（observation decoders），仅保留 7% KL 梯度。\n      dt_emb 基本不训练 → 等效于 frozen embedding → CIVO 环路完全断开。\n      NVE 持续在 0.5-0.72 范围（与 015b frozen 的 0.39-0.47 一致，略高因为 7% KL 梯度\n      允许微弱训练）。NVE 从不超过 1.1x → 满足 best 档要求。\n      Eval 448.3 (49% baseline) 反映\"inherent cost of multi-dt training without proper \n      temporal abstraction\"——这是 C5 的体现，不是 CIVO。\n      CIVO 独立贡献量化：008d 86% degradation vs 018v2 51% degradation → CIVO 贡献 35pp。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"CIVO decomposition\"\n        columns: [\"config\", \"eval@105K\", \"vs_baseline\", \"NVE\", \"degradation_source\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"baseline\", \"916\", \"0%\", \"0.66\", \"-\"]\n          - [\"018v2 (Full-SGS)\", \"448\", \"-51%\", \"0.72\", \"inherent multi-dt cost only\"]\n          - [\"008d (trained dt_emb)\", \"83\", \"-91%\", \"4.12→collapse\", \"inherent + CIVO\"]\n          - [\"CIVO contribution\", \"-\", \"35pp\", \"-\", \"008d_degrad(91%) - 018v2_degrad(51%) = 35pp + collapse\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar: total degradation decomposed into inherent cost (51pp) + CIVO contribution (35pp + collapse)\"\n    analysis: >\n      CIVO 独立贡献 35pp 作为量化结果有力——不是模糊的\"causes degradation\"而是精确的\"adds 35pp \n      degradation on top of inherent cost, plus stochastic catastrophic collapse\"。\n      civo_independent_contribution_pp = 35，落入 best 档 [30, 40] 范围。\n      Full-SGS 作为验证工具（不是推荐方案）彻底闭合了 CIVO 因果链。\n\n  - name: \"exp_020 vanilla baseline 排除 confound\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_020_vanilla\"\n    description: \"纯净 DreamerV3 (无任何 dt 修改) baseline seed 2，排除代码/环境 confound\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_final_500K: 940\n      vs_exp_001: \"+/-2%\"\n      ve_stable: 0.70\n      convergence_identical: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档核心假设 #4：\"exp_020 vanilla baseline 与 exp_001 一致\"。\n      exp_001 使用了添加了 dt_embedding 代码但 dt=1 的配置。\n      exp_020 使用完全 vanilla DreamerV3（无任何 dt 修改）。\n      如果两者一致 → dt=1 下 dt_embedding 代码的存在不引入 confound。\n      预期 eval 940 (vs exp_001 的 950.9 last10 mean)，差异 <2%（在 seed 方差内）。\n      V/E 收敛到 0.70 与 exp_001 的 0.69-0.72 一致。\n      这排除了\"性能差异源于代码修改本身\"的审稿顾虑。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Vanilla vs modified baseline comparison\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"exp_001 (dt_emb code, dt=1)\", \"exp_020 (vanilla)\", \"delta\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"eval_peak\", \"970.4\", \"965\", \"-0.6%\"]\n          - [\"eval_last10_mean\", \"950.9\", \"940\", \"-1.1%\"]\n          - [\"ve_stable\", \"0.69-0.72\", \"0.69-0.71\", \"identical\"]\n          - [\"convergence_step\", \"~135K\", \"~130K\", \"~same\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Two overlapping learning curves: exp_001 vs exp_020\"\n    analysis: >\n      <2% 差异在 single-seed variance 内。确认 dt_embedding 代码在 dt=1 时是 no-op，\n      所有性能差异确实来自 dt>1 配置变化而非代码 artifact。\n\n  - name: \"008f_s3 第三独立 seed 确认\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008f_s3\"\n    description: \"dt_embed_dim=0 的第三个独立 seed，确认 NVE protection 的 robustness\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_105K: 380\n      nve_peak: 1.15\n      nve_105K: 0.55\n      collapse: false\n      below_1_5x: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档核心假设 #2：\"008f_s3 NVE < 1.5×\"。\n      已有 seed 1 (NVE peak 1.02) 和 seed 2 (NVE peak 1.26)，\n      第三 seed 预期 NVE peak ~1.15（在 1.0-1.3 范围内）。\n      dt_embed_dim=0 的保护是结构性的（完全移除 dt conditioning channel），\n      不应有 seed 能突破 1.5x——因为 CIVO 环路的必要组件（dt_emb）完全不存在。\n      Eval 380 落在 seed 1 (503) 和 seed 2 (148) 之间——高方差是 008f 配置的特征\n      （reward noise 导致 learning signal 含噪，性能波动大）。\n      但关键指标 NVE < 1.5x 应 3/3 一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"008f all-seed NVE summary\"\n        columns: [\"seed\", \"NVE peak\", \"eval@105K\", \"collapse\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"seed 1\", \"1.02\", \"503\", \"NO\"]\n          - [\"seed 2\", \"1.26\", \"148\", \"NO\"]\n          - [\"seed 3\", \"1.15\", \"380\", \"NO\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"008f 3-seed NVE trajectory with 1.5x ceiling highlighted\"\n    analysis: >\n      3/3 seeds 低于 1.5x 进一步巩固因果控制。\n      bootstrap_exceedance_pct (trained > untrained): \n      所有 trained seeds 的 NVE peak 分布 vs untrained seeds 的 NVE peak 分布 → \n      exceedance 100%（0% overlap），满足 best 档 [95, 100] 范围。\n\n  - name: \"Bootstrap CI and exceedance analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_034_bootstrap\"\n    description: \"Bootstrap 置信区间量化 trained vs untrained Δ NVE 的统计显著性\"\n    expected_results:\n      delta_nve_mean: 2.29\n      delta_nve_ci_lower: 0.91\n      delta_nve_ci_upper: 3.10\n      ci_excludes_zero: true\n      exceedance_pct_trained_over_untrained: 100\n      exceedance_pct_untrained_over_trained: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档要求 bootstrap_ci_delta_nve_lower_bound ∈ [0.5, 1.5] 和 exceedance_pct ∈ [95, 100]。\n      从现有数据：trained NVE peaks = {4.12, 2.09, 2.05, 1.62, 14.59} (mean ~4.9)；\n      untrained NVE peaks = {1.02, 1.26, 0.93, 0.47, 1.15} (mean ~0.97)。\n      Δ mean = 3.93，但 bootstrap 10000 次重采样的 95% CI lower bound\n      受小样本限制，估计为 0.91（受单个高值 14.59 的影响 CI 较宽）。\n      如果去掉 Cheetah outlier，Walker-only Δ NVE mean = 2.29，CI [0.91, 3.10]。\n      Exceedance: P(random trained > random untrained) = 100%（分布完全不重叠）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Bootstrap inference\"\n        columns: [\"metric\", \"value\", \"best tier range\", \"status\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Δ NVE mean (Walker)\", \"2.29\", \"-\", \"✓\"]\n          - [\"95% CI lower bound\", \"0.91\", \"[0.5, 1.5]\", \"✓ (within)\"]\n          - [\"95% CI upper bound\", \"3.10\", \"-\", \"-\"]\n          - [\"Exceedance %\", \"100%\", \"[95, 100]\", \"✓\"]\n          - [\"N trained\", \"5\", \"-\", \"-\"]\n          - [\"N untrained\", \"5\", \"-\", \"-\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bootstrap distribution histogram of Δ NVE with 95% CI shaded\"\n    analysis: >\n      CI lower bound 0.91 > 0 → statistically significant separation at α=0.05。\n      Exceedance 100% → no overlap between groups。\n      Small sample (n=5 per group) limits CI tightness，但完美 separation 使结论 robust。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"08bdb50e-1069-4ff6-8dd1-d71d2e122e57","total_cost_usd":0.79543975,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41989,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"output_tokens":19625,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41989,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":19625,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation_input_tokens":41989,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":41989},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":36540,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.03665,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":19625,"cacheReadInputTokens":11447,"cacheCreationInputTokens":41989,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.75878975,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"a5eab6e7-a233-4d61-9f5c-b8d3717ad33c"}
